something more useful and healthy. Imagine you could walk into a room and be able to sift through enormous data sets by sound alone. We actually create an idealized sound scape for what a sonification of data idea might be in a hospital room of the future. Basically, I think is in good shape. Maybe a week we can look at the chart again and make sure it sounds good. You don't need to be a musician, you don't need to be really intensely trained for this. You can determine whether a pitch is higher than another or lower than another if they're pretty far apart.
更有用、更健康的东西。想象一下，你可以走进一个房间，仅凭声音就能筛选庞大的数据集。我们实际上为未来医院病房中的数据声化构想创造了一个理想的声景。基本上，我认为情况很好。也许一周后我们可以再次查看图表，确保它听起来不错。你不需要成为音乐家，你不需要为此接受过高强度的专业训练。如果两个音高相距较远，你就能判断出一个音高是比另一个高还是低。

